DRM (ETSI ES 201 980) AAC encoder for fdk-aac 2.0.3 (mstorsjo/fdk-aac tag v2.0.3, 716f439).
Apply in the fdk-aac source root:  patch -p1 < fdk-aac-2.0.3-drm-encoder.patch  (or git apply)

Adds to the encoder: AACENC_TRANSMUX = TT_DRM, AACENC_GRANULE_LENGTH = 960, DRM AU syntax
(ER-AAC-SCAL-like element order, VCB11, Huffman codeword reordering, aac_crc_bits CRC-8 as first
byte), DRM SBR (scalable syntax + 8 bit DRM SBR CRC, written bit-reversed at the end of the AU),
MPEG-4 PS via AOT_PS. Capability flags: AACENC CAPF_AAC_960|CAPF_AAC_DRM_BSFORMAT,
TPENC CAPF_DRM, SBRENC CAPF_SBR_DRM_BS. Default (non-DRM) behaviour is unchanged.
Fraunhofer FDK AAC license applies to the patched library (see NOTICE in fdk-aac).

